        ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
        │ Keys                                                         │
        │ task                                                         │
        │ > enter       task.open           Open the task's page       │
        │   x           task.done           Mark the task done and     │
        │                                   move it to the archive     │
        │   e           task.edit           Edit the task's title in a │
        │                                   prompt                     │
        │   n           task.note           Add a note to the task     │
        │   d d         task.delete         Delete the task after a    │
        │                                   confirm                    │
        │   d esc       mode.leave          Return from a pending mode │
        │                                   to the mode it shadowed    │
        │ list                                                         │
        │   space       list.mark           Toggle the mark on a row   │
        │                                   (the selected row by       │
        │                                   default) for fan-out verbs │
        │ app                                                          │
        │   ctrl+c      app.quit            Exit the application       │
        │   "           mode.enter          Pick the register the next │
        │                                   yank, delete or paste uses │
        │                                   ("a)                       │
        │   q           mode.enter          Record a macro into the    │
        │                                   register typed next (qa);  │
        │                                   q again stops              │
        │   @           mode.enter          Replay the macro in the    │
        │                                   register typed next (@a),  │
        │                                   count times                │
        │   1-9         mode.enter          Start a count for the next │
        │                                   key (3j)                   │
        │   .           history.repeat      Dot-repeat: run the last   │
        │                                   repeatable change again at │
        │                                   the current focus, its     │
        │                                   arguments kept; steps      │
        │                                   replaces its count         │
        │   :           palette.open        Open the command line      │
        │   ctrl+y      yank-history.open   Select a previous          │
        │                                   application yank without   │
        │                                   inserting it               │
        │   ?           bindings.help       Open the keys the focus    │
        │                                   answers to, with the       │
        │                                   operation each runs and    │
        │                                   its description            │
        │   ctrl+space  palette.open        Open the command line      │
        │ movement                                                     │
        │   j           list.move           Move the selection; past   │
        │                                   the edge, on to the next   │
        │                                   stop on the page           │
        │   down        list.move           Move the selection; past   │
        │                                   the edge, on to the next   │
        │                                   stop on the page           │
        │ 1–19 / 33                                                    │
        │ space list.mark · esc modal.pop · : palette.open · ? bindin… │
